eckmark:\r\n        st.tabs([\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"])\r\n    else:\r\n        st.tabs([\"1\", \"2\"])\r\n\r\n\r\nshow_page()\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps To Reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Run the code example\r\n2. Click on \"Yes or No\" twice\r\n3. When going back to the original tabs, an extra tab (\"C\") should appear.\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Current Behavior\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/619ca8d8-f6f3-4ef8-b73e-27b019f23294)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/440d2890-be3e-4c75-b734-2ed8f479fc51)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c4c7f3a-31dd-4351-a63d-f3142a63aa09)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Is this a regression?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes, this used to work in a previous version.\r\n\r\n### Debug info\r\n\r\n- Streamlit version: 1.37.0\r\n- Python version: 3.11.8\r\n- Operating System: WSL2 on Windows 11\r\n- Browser: Google Chrome\r\n\r\n\r\n### Additional Information\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"raethlein","id":3775781,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzU3ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3775781?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein","html_url":"https://github.com/raethlein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raethlein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/stre